        "date": "2026-11-27T00:24:07Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(tools): shrink-fit chucks, BT50 and CAT50 holders; every taper is a spindle mount\n\nThe holder library gets DIN 69882-8 shrink-fit chucks on each taper\nbut TTS (one envelope of the 4.5-degree nose cone and the 45-degree\nflare, 2 mm over the table in radius), BT50 and CAT50 with ER16-ER40\nand every Weldon bore, and a grouped \"<taper> Shrink\" picker row.\nSPINDLE_MOUNTS lists each library taper; an app test keeps the two\nlists equal, and an unknown mount is still refused by name. Numbers\nand sources: docs/decisions/3919-standard-holders-2.md.\n\nRefs #3919\nFixes #4239\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "tree": {
